  <Row><Cell>merc_provider_jan_posy</Cell><Cell>With him, I don't think you'll need anyone else.</Cell><Cell>有他在,我看你不需要別人了。</Cell></Row>

  <Row><Cell>ui_mercenary_custom_miroslav</Cell><Cell>Miroslav Tugbone (1500 groschen).</Cell><Cell>米羅斯拉夫·拖骨(1500格羅申)。</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>merc_henry_miroslav</Cell><Cell>Send for Miroslav.</Cell><Cell>去請米羅斯拉夫來。</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>merc_provider_miroslav</Cell><Cell>Let's hope his bone isn't stuck somewhere.</Cell><Cell>但願他的骨頭沒卡在哪裡。</Cell></Row>

