  <Row><Cell>merc_henry_arne</Cell><Cell>I'll take Arne.</Cell><Cell>我要阿爾內。</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>merc_provider_arne</Cell><Cell>Alright, but I don't think he speaks any Czech...</Cell><Cell>好吧,不過我看他一句捷克話都不會說……</Cell></Row>

  <Row><Cell>ui_mercenary_custom_janek</Cell><Cell>Janek of Skalitz (800 groschen).</Cell><Cell>斯卡利采的雅內克(800格羅申)。</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>merc_henry_janek</Cell><Cell>Get me Janek.</Cell><Cell>去把雅內克找來。</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>merc_provider_janek</Cell><Cell>I see the old crowd is getting together.</Cell><Cell>看來老班底又要聚在一起了。</Cell></Row>

  <Row><Cell>ui_mercenary_custom_jaroslav</Cell><Cell>Jaroslav (800 groschen).</Cell><Cell>雅羅斯拉夫(800格羅申)。</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>merc_henry_jaroslav</Cell><Cell>I need Jaroslav.</Cell><Cell>我需要雅羅斯拉夫。</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>merc_provider_jaroslav</Cell><Cell>I think he's winning the beard-growing bet.</Cell><Cell>我看他在留鬍子比賽裡快贏了。</Cell></Row>

  <Row><Cell>ui_mercenary_custom_adder</Cell><Cell>Adder (1500 groschen).</Cell><Cell>毒蝮(1500格羅申)。</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>merc_henry_adder</Cell><Cell>I'll take Adder.</Cell><Cell>我要毒蝮。</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>merc_provider_adder</Cell><Cell>I'll call on the local butcher.</Cell><Cell>我去找本地的屠夫問問。</Cell></Row>

