  <Row><Cell>merc_henry_janosh</Cell><Cell>Send for Janosh.</Cell><Cell>去請雅諾什來。</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>merc_provider_janosh</Cell><Cell>I see you are a true gourmand.</Cell><Cell>看來你真是個講究吃食的人。</Cell></Row>

