  <Row><Cell>merc_provider_archers</Cell><Cell>Archers, eh? I know a few lads with steady hands. How good should they be?</Cell><Cell>Archers, eh? I know a few lads with steady hands. How good should they be?</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>ui_archer_tier_weak</Cell><Cell>The cheapest (75 groschen).</Cell><Cell>The cheapest (75 groschen).</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>merc_henry_archer_weak</Cell><Cell>Whatever's cheapest, as long as they can loose an arrow.</Cell><Cell>Whatever's cheapest, as long as they can loose an arrow.</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>merc_provider_archer_weak</Cell><Cell>Poachers, mostly. 75 groschen a head. How many?</Cell><Cell>Poachers, mostly. 75 groschen a head. How many?</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>ui_archer_tier_medium</Cell><Cell>Some decent shots (150 groschen).</Cell><Cell>Some decent shots (150 groschen).</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>merc_henry_archer_medium</Cell><Cell>Someone who can actually hit what they aim at.</Cell><Cell>Someone who can actually hit what they aim at.</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>merc_provider_archer_medium</Cell><Cell>Proper hunters. 150 groschen a head. How many?</Cell><Cell>Proper hunters. 150 groschen a head. How many?</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>ui_archer_tier_good</Cell><Cell>A master archer (400 groschen).</Cell><Cell>A master archer (400 groschen).</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>merc_henry_archer_good</Cell><Cell>The best bowman you can find.</Cell><Cell>The best bowman you can find.</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>merc_provider_archer_good</Cell><Cell>War archers, tournament winners. 400 groschen a head. How many?</Cell><Cell>War archers, tournament winners. 400 groschen a head. How many?</Cell></Row>
