  <Row><Cell>merc_test_archer_hub_prompt</Cell><Cell>The bowmen are listening. How should we fight?</Cell><Cell>The bowmen are listening. How should we fight?</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>ui_archer_stance_skirmish</Cell><Cell>Skirmish - keep your distance and shoot.</Cell><Cell>Skirmish - keep your distance and shoot.</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>merc_henry_archer_skirmish</Cell><Cell>Stay at range and keep the arrows coming. Don't let them get close.</Cell><Cell>Stay at range and keep the arrows coming. Don't let them get close.</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>merc_test_archer_skirmish</Cell><Cell>We'll keep them at arm's length and feather them. If one gets in our face, he'll taste steel.</Cell><Cell>We'll keep them at arm's length and feather them. If one gets in our face, he'll taste steel.</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>ui_archer_stance_guard</Cell><Cell>Stay behind me and shoot from there.</Cell><Cell>Stay behind me and shoot from there.</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>merc_henry_archer_guard</Cell><Cell>Stick close to me and shoot over my shoulder.</Cell><Cell>Stick close to me and shoot over my shoulder.</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>merc_test_archer_guard</Cell><Cell>We'll shadow you and shoot whatever comes at you.</Cell><Cell>We'll shadow you and shoot whatever comes at you.</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>ui_archer_stance_melee</Cell><Cell>Draw steel and get in there.</Cell><Cell>Draw steel and get in there.</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>merc_henry_archer_melee</Cell><Cell>Put the bows away. I want blades in the melee.</Cell><Cell>Put the bows away. I want blades in the melee.</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>merc_test_archer_melee</Cell><Cell>As you wish. Steel it is.</Cell><Cell>As you wish. Steel it is.</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>ui_archer_stance_hold</Cell><Cell>Hold your fire.</Cell><Cell>Hold your fire.</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>merc_henry_archer_hold</Cell><Cell>Hold your fire. Nobody shoots unless I say so.</Cell><Cell>Hold your fire. Nobody shoots unless I say so.</Cell></Row>
  <Row><Cell>merc_test_archer_hold</Cell><Cell>Understood. Not an arrow until you give the word.</Cell><Cell>Understood. Not an arrow until you give the word.</Cell></Row>
